# nth Setup's words, English (nth installer PLAN.md 3, "Text"; the approved canvas work/design/installer/index.html).
# Every string the setup window shows comes from this table, so the window can be translated without code changes:
# another language is another table with the same keys (SetupStrings.<language>). One "key = value" per line; spaces
# around the value are not kept; {0}, {1} are filled in by the code. A key ending in .one / .other is a count's form.
# Lower-case "nth" everywhere (OD-0135). Apostrophes and quotes are the typographic ones (ED-NEW-inst-u1-1, 6).

